<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="sl">What We Repair</p>
    <h2>Every major home appliance across Santa Barbara County</h2>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <a href="/services/refrigerator-repair/" class="svc-card"><div class="svc-icon">❄️</div><h3>Refrigerator Repair</h3><p>All brands and built-ins. Sub-Zero columns and coastal coil corrosion handled.</p></a>
      <a href="/services/washer-repair/" class="svc-card"><div class="svc-icon">👕</div><h3>Washer Repair</h3><p>Front-load, top-load, stacked. Hard-water scale is a South Coast staple.</p></a>
      <a href="/services/dryer-repair/" class="svc-card"><div class="svc-icon">💨</div><h3>Dryer Repair</h3><p>Gas and electric. Vent inspection included when relevant.</p></a>
      <a href="/services/dishwasher-repair/" class="svc-card"><div class="svc-icon">🍽️</div><h3>Dishwasher Repair</h3><p>Miele, Bosch, KitchenAid, Samsung. Scale from hard water is the local pattern.</p></a>
      <a href="/services/oven-repair/" class="svc-card"><div class="svc-icon">🔥</div><h3>Oven & Range Repair</h3><p>Gas, electric, dual-fuel. Wolf, Viking, Thermador serviced with OEM parts.</p></a>
      <a href="/services/wine-cellar-cooling-repair/" class="svc-card"><div class="svc-icon">🍷</div><h3>Wine Cellar Cooling</h3><p>Wine rooms and cellar cooling units — a real category here, this close to the Santa Ynez Valley.</p></a>
      <a href="/outdoor/kitchen-repair/" class="svc-card"><div class="svc-icon">🔆</div><h3>Outdoor Kitchen & Grill Repair</h3><p>Built-in grills, outdoor refrigeration, patio heaters — the category almost nobody else on the South Coast services.</p></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-black">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="context-cols">
      <div class="context-text">
        <p class="sl">Santa Barbara County Appliance Context</p>
        <h2>Two things break appliances here: salt air and hard water</h2>
        <p>The marine layer sits on the South Coast most mornings from May through August, and homes on the Mesa, near the harbor, and along the Summerland and Carpinteria coast get salt air on top of it. Condenser coils corrode faster within a mile of the water — we inspect them on every refrigerator call as standard, because catching coil corrosion early is the difference between a cleaning and a sealed-system repair.</p>
        <p>Inland of the salt line, the problem flips to water. The South Coast's supply blends Cachuma Lake, groundwater, State Water Project deliveries, and the city's desalination plant — and it runs moderately hard to hard. Dishwashers, ice makers, and washers scale at year 3–5 without descaling maintenance. If your dishwasher leaves film and your ice tastes off, that's the water, and it's fixable.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="context-facts">
        <div class="cfact"><h4>🏡 Estate density (Montecito, Hope Ranch)</h4><p>Built-in Sub-Zero, Wolf, Viking, Thermador, Miele at Bel Air density. OEM parts on the truck.</p></div>
        <div class="cfact"><h4>🌊 Salt air (Mesa, harbor, Summerland, Carpinteria)</h4><p>Coil corrosion runs faster near the water. Coil inspection standard on every fridge call.</p></div>
        <div class="cfact"><h4>💧 Hard water (Cachuma + State Water blend)</h4><p>Dishwasher and ice maker scale at year 3–5. Descaling maintenance pays for itself.</p></div>
        <div class="cfact"><h4>🏢 Dedicated Santa Barbara branch</h4><p>(805) 500-0855 is a South Coast number — one continuous 101 route with our Thousand Oaks branch, not LA dispatch.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- COMMERCIAL -->
<section class="section section-commercial">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="sl">Commercial Service · Santa Barbara County</p>
    <h2>Commercial Appliance Repair in Santa Barbara County</h2>
    <p class="commercial-intro">The South Coast's commercial calls cluster in three places: the State Street and Funk Zone restaurant and tasting-room scene, the waterfront and harbor kitchens where salt air chews through commercial refrigeration the way it does on residential units, and the hotel corridor from Montecito through Goleta. Wine tasting rooms are their own category — undercounter refrigeration and glass washers in spaces that were never designed as kitchens. We service all of it from the Santa Barbara branch, $120 commercial diagnostic, waived with repair. Hotels, restaurants, and property managers can set up account terms through our <a href="/for-business/">business service</a> desk.</p>
    <div class="commercial-grid">
      <div class="ccard"><div class="ccard-icon">🍽️</div><h3><a href="/commercial/refrigeration/">Commercial Refrigeration</a></h3><p>Walk-in coolers, reach-ins, prep tables. <a href="/brands/true/">True</a>, Turbo Air, <a href="/brands/beverage-air/">Beverage-Air</a>.</p></div>
